abstract: "A clean, reproducible Google Colab pipeline for MM/GBSA & MM/PBSA binding free energy analysis from GROMACS MD trajectories. Includes GB vs PB comparison, NMODE entropy correction, per-residue decomposition, and publication-ready 300 dpi plots for Protein-LIG systems."
